<p><b>Middnite's Bio:</b>
<table border=1 width=400>
  <tr><td>
  As the 3rd born child of House D´Baenre in Neriak a promising future was not in sight for me. But then my big sister Sartassa assassinated the first born son of our family and was banned. She had to leave House D`Baenre and changed her name in Dunkelsonne. I never understood why she was banned. I was still young, too young even and she granted me some support, helped me to stay alive until was strong enough to do it alone. She brought me into the Bloodhorde, where I grew further. And finally one day, after our Mother, as the 1st member of House D`Baenre, was murdered with poison (isn´t it suspicious, he?), I became the new leader of this House. I must confess, I didn´t feel very save anymore with Sartassa sneeking around in Neriak. So I threw her in chains in the Freeport tunnels.


“I don´t care if they love or hate me as long as they are scared of me!”

Middnite D`Baenre,

Shadowknight and worshipper of Innoruuk
